e essential information.  The inclusion of the University's name and location is helpful.", 'ats_match': '85%', 'recommendations': ['Consider adding any relevant coursework, projects, or honors related to your field to further highlight your academic achievements.']}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "You've presented a strong set of skills, including programming languages, frameworks, and tools. This demonstrates your expertise and suitability for a wide range of roles.", 'ats_match': '90%', 'recommendations': ['You could consider grouping your skills into categories (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks, Databases) to enhance readability.']}, {'title': 'Awards and Certifications', 'description': "This section is missing. It's a valuable opportunity to showcase any accomplishments or certifications that demonstrate your skills and commitment to professional development. Consider adding any relevant certifications or awards that you may have received, for example: 'Certified Scrum Master' or 'Google Cloud Certified Professional' ", 'ats_match': 'N/A', 'recommendations': ['Add this section to further highlight your skills and professional achievements.']}, {'title': 'Projects', 'description': "This section is missing.  It's a great way to showcase independent work and further demonstrate your technical skills. Consider adding a section with a few projects you've worked on. Provide a brief description of each project, its purpose, technologies used, and the results achieved. ", 'ats_match': 'N/A', 'recommendations': ['Include a dedicated section for your personal projects and highlight your key contributions.']}, {'title': 'Additional Information', 'description': 'This section is missing.  Consider including additional relevant information that strengthens your application, such as your personal interests, volunteer work, or leadership experiences. This can help you stand out from other candidates.', 'ats_match': 'N/A', 'recommendations': ['Add a section for additional information to showcase your well-rounded profile.']}]}
