2024-09-02 20:55:40,692 - app - INFO - Session data after upload: <SecureCookieSession {'ai_response': {'feedback_cards': [{'ats_match': '75%', 'description': "Your summary effectively highlights your passion for software development, specifically mentioning fintech, AI, and mobile app development.  You've  demonstrated  your proficiency in  various technologies like Java Spring Boot, Python Flask, and Flutter.  However, consider  reframing  this  section  to  be  more  action-oriented and  quantifiable,  emphasizing  specific  achievements  that  align with the role you're targeting.  For  example,  you  could  mention  the  number  of  successful  projects  completed  or  the  percentage  increase  in  efficiency  you've  achieved  using  certain  technologies.", 'recommendations': ["Quantify your achievements using metrics and numbers. For example, instead of saying you 'optimized systems,' mention the percentage increase in efficiency you achieved.  \nFocus on achievements that are directly relevant to the role you're applying for.  Tailor  this  section  for  each  job  application, highlighting  skills  and  experiences  that  align  with  the  specific  requirements.  \nMake  it  action-oriented.  Instead  of  stating  'I'm dedicated to solving real-world problems,'  explain  how you  have  done  this  in  the  past  and  the  positive  outcomes  achieved."], 'title': 'Summary'}, {'ats_match': '85%', 'description': "Your experience section provides a good overview of your diverse roles in software development. You've  demonstrated  your  ability  to  work  on various projects, from developing RESTful APIs to leading AI development initiatives. The use of specific examples and quantifiable results, like the 70% reduction in response times and 20% increase in performance, adds credibility to your claims.  \nHowever, you can further strengthen this section by highlighting your contributions to each project in a more concise and impactful manner. Consider using bullet points to list your key responsibilities and achievements within each role, focusing on the skills and experiences most relevant to the target job.", 'recommendations': ["Use bullet points to list your responsibilities and achievements. This will make it easier for recruiters to quickly understand your contributions.  \nPrioritize the skills and experiences that are most relevant to the job you're applying for.  Tailor  each  role  description  to  highlight  the  skills  and  experiences  that  are  most  aligned  with  the  specific  job  requirements.  \nQuantify  your  achievements.  Whenever  possible,  use  metrics  and  numbers  to  demonstrate  the  impact  of  your  work."], 'title': 'Experience'}, {'ats_match': '90%', 'description': 'Your educational background in Computer Science from Catholic University College, Ghana, is a solid foundation for your software development career. The dates of your study are clearly stated, which is helpful for potential employers. However, you can enhance this section by adding relevant coursework or projects that showcase your technical skills and abilities.  \nConsider highlighting any academic honors, awards, or research projects that demonstrate your capabilities.', 'recommendations': ["List  any  relevant  coursework  or  projects  that  showcase  your  technical  skills  and  abilities.  For  example,  mention  specific  programming  languages  you  learned  or  projects  you  completed  that  are  related  to  the  job  you're  applying  for. \nHighlight  any  academic  honors,  awards,  or  research  projects  that  demonstrate  your  capabilities.  This  can  help  to  set  you  apart  from  other  candidates  and  show  your  commitment  to  your  field."], 'title': 'Education'}, {'ats_match': '95%', 'description': "This section provides a comprehensive list of your technical skills, including programming languages, frameworks, and tools. You've  effectively  highlighted  your  proficiency  in  Java, Python, Dart, SQL, PL/SQL, JavaScript, Spring Boot, Angular, Flutter, Flask, Kafka, Git, and Jenkins. This demonstrates a strong foundation in various technologies.  \nHowever, consider customizing this list based on the specific job requirements. For example, if the job description emphasizes experience with specific frameworks or tools, highlight those skills prominently.", 'recommendations': ["Prioritize  the  skills  that  are  most  relevant  to  the  job  you're  applying  for.  You  can  do  this  by  placing  those  skills  at  the  top  of  the  list  or  by  grouping  them  together  in  a  separate  section.  \nConsider adding a few soft skills, such as communication, teamwork, problem-solving, and critical thinking. These skills are  important  for  any  role  and  can  help  you  to  stand  out  from  other  candidates."], 'title': 'Skills'}], 'overall_feedback': 'Bamidele, your resume showcases a strong technical foundation and impressive experience in software development, particularly in fintech and AI. However, it lacks a clear focus on the specific role you are applying for. Tailor the content to align with the requirements of each job application for maximum impact.'}, 'file_uri': 'gs://genaiq_cloudbuild/uploads/OlusegunTewogbadeResume.pdf', 'filename': 'OlusegunTewogbadeResume.pdf'}>
