sier for recruiters to quickly grasp the nature of your work.'], 'title': 'Experience'}, {'ats_match': '70%', 'description': 'This section effectively lists your technical skills and demonstrates your proficiency in various programming languages, frameworks, and tools.  However, it could be improved by categorizing the skills and prioritizing the most relevant ones for the target roles.', 'recommendations': ['Organize your skills into categories (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks and Libraries, Tools and Platforms) to make them more scannable.', 'Highlight the most relevant skills for each job application by placing them at the top of the list.'], 'title': 'Skills'}, {'ats_match': '80%', 'description': "This section is concise and clearly presents your educational background. You've mentioned your degree, institution, and graduation dates.", 'recommendations': ['If applicable, consider adding any relevant coursework or projects that showcase your technical abilities.'], 'title': 'Education'}, {'ats_match': '50%', 'description': 'While your personal information is clearly presented, consider adding a section for awards, certifications, or other relevant accomplishments. This can add value to your resume and demonstrate your commitment to professional development.', 'recommendations': ['Add a section for awards, certifications, volunteer work, or relevant projects that showcase your skills and achievements beyond your professional experience.'], 'title': 'Additional Information'}, {'ats_match': '75%', 'description': 'Overall, your resume has a strong ATS match percentage. However, further optimization can improve its chances of being selected by ATS systems. By incorporating the suggested improvements, you can increase its visibility to recruiters and improve your chances of landing your dream job.', 'recommendations': ['Use keywords relevant to the target roles you are applying for throughout your resume, especially in the summary, experience, and skills sections.', 'Ensure that your contact information is properly formatted and easily accessible.  Use a consistent font and font size throughout your resume to maintain a professional appearance.'], 'title': 'ATS Match'}], 'overall_feedback': "Olusegun, your resume showcases a strong foundation in software development with a clear focus on fintech and AI. You've demonstrated impressive technical skills, leadership qualities, and a proven ability to deliver impactful solutions. Your experience at Fasyl Technology Group, where you designed and deployed RESTful APIs for banks across Africa, is particularly impressive. However, there are areas where you can enhance your resume to further highlight your achievements and make it more ATS-friendly."}, 'file_uri': 'gs://genaiq_cloudbuild/uploads/Olusegun_Tewogbade.pdf', 'filename': 'Olusegun_Tewogbade.pdf'}>
