ight your specific skills and knowledge.']}, {'title': 'Overall ATS Match', 'description': "Olusegun's resume has a strong ATS match percentage, which signifies that his resume is effectively conveying his skills and experience to Applicant Tracking Systems. However, optimizing the resume further by incorporating relevant keywords and refining the structure can boost its score even more.", 'ats_match': '80%', 'recommendations': ['Use a tool like Jobscan to analyze your resume against specific job descriptions. This will identify areas for improvement and help you tailor your resume for each application.']}]}
