he achievements more impactful.  Instead of 'Designed and deployed', try 'Developed and deployed.'"]}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': 'The skills section lists a strong set of programming languages, frameworks, and tools that Olusegun is proficient in. This section clearly demonstrates his technical expertise and adaptability.', 'ats_match': '95%', 'recommendations': ["Consider organizing the skills into categories such as 'Programming Languages', 'Frameworks & Libraries', and 'Tools & Platforms' for better readability."]}]}
