sibilities.\\n", "Prioritize achievements over responsibilities. Start each bullet point with a strong action verb and quantify the impact whenever possible.\\n", "Consider using a more visually appealing format, like bullet points or a table, for presenting the details of each role."]}, {"title": "Education", "description": "Olusegun\'s educational background is well presented, showcasing his degree in Computer Science from Catholic University College, Ghana. The inclusion of the graduation date provides valuable information. To further enhance this section, consider mentioning any relevant coursework or projects that demonstrate your skills and interests.", "ats_match": "90%", "recommendations": ["Consider adding a brief description of any relevant coursework or projects that demonstrate your skills and interests.\\n", "Highlight any academic achievements or awards related to your field."]}, {"title": "Skills", "description": "Olusegun lists a strong set of skills, including programming languages, frameworks, tools, and platforms. The organization of skills by category is helpful. However, consider adding a level of proficiency for each skill to provide a clearer understanding of his expertise.", "ats_match": "95%", "recommendations": ["Add a proficiency level for each skill (e.g., Expert, Proficient, Familiar) to provide a more nuanced understanding of your skillset.\\n", "Consider highlighting any specialized or niche skills that align with your target roles.\\n", "Tailor your skills list to the specific job requirements, demonstrating your alignment with the company\'s needs."}]}]}\n'}
