 Bamidele's degree and institution.  It could be enhanced by including any relevant coursework, projects, or academic achievements.", 'ats_match': '60%', 'recommendations': ['Include relevant coursework, projects, or academic achievements that demonstrate your skills and knowledge. Consider adding a GPA or any honors received.']}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': "The skills section effectively showcases Bamidele's programming languages, frameworks, tools, and platforms. It would be beneficial to organize them into categories for better readability.", 'ats_match': '85%', 'recommendations': ['Organize skills into categories (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks, Tools). Consider adding specific skills related to the roles you are targeting.']}]}
