vements for each role.']}, {'title': 'Education', 'description': 'This section provides basic information about your education, but it could be more informative. Consider expanding it to include relevant coursework, projects, or academic achievements that demonstrate your technical skills and knowledge.', 'ats_match': '60%', 'recommendations': ['Highlight any relevant coursework or projects that demonstrate your technical skills.', 'Mention any academic awards or honors related to your field.', 'Include any additional certifications or training you may have completed.']}, {'title': 'Skills', 'description': 'This section lists a solid set of skills, showcasing your proficiency in various programming languages, frameworks, and tools. However, consider  grouping these skills  into  categories  to  make  them  more  scannable  and  understandable  for  recruiters.', 'ats_match': '80%', 'recommendations': ['Categorize skills (e.g., Programming Languages, Frameworks, Tools, etc.) for better readability.', 'Highlight the skills most relevant to the target job role.', 'Consider adding quantifiable skills, like proficiency levels (e.g., Expert, Advanced, Proficient, etc.)']}]}
